  "result": "Perfect! All 51 tests pass (35 original + 16 new). I've added `addLine()` and `removeLine()` functions with full validation.\n\n**Changes:**\n\n1. **Added error codes** to `src/errors.js`:\n   - `NOT_DRAFT`: Only draft invoices can be modified\n   - `LINE_NOT_FOUND`: No line with that SKU on the invoice\n\n2. **`addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })`**:\n   - Adds a new line or increases qty if SKU already exists\n   - Validates qty (positive integer) and SKU (exists in catalogue)\n   - Rejects non-draft invoices (NOT_DRAFT)\n   - Returns new invoice without mutating the original\n\n3. **`removeLine(invoice, sku)`**:\n   - Removes a line by SKU\n   - Returns LINE_NOT_FOUND if SKU not on invoice\n   - Returns NO_LINES if it would remove the last line\n   - Rejects non-draft invoices (NOT_DRAFT)\n   - Returns new invoice without mutating the original\n\n**Tests added (16 new, 51 total passing):**\n- Adding new lines and updating existing quantities\n- Validation of qty and SKU\n- Draft status enforcement\n- Input immutability\n- Operation chaining (add, add, remove sequence)",
